  "limits": [
    "Nine entries are owner instances, not nine distinct vtable classes or a proof all lifetimes are disjoint; the two school workers coexist and addresses are reused across different TIDs.",
    "4B90FE is a captured saved return ancestor with matching original CALL bytes. No current EIP at4B90FE, actual wait return, full instruction trace or PTD release is inferred.",
    "The source stores decoded EBP links and separate raw ancestry argument words; this review verifies that representation and raw argument addresses, not unrecorded entire stack memory.",
    "The sixth mouse release has no fast release row; its actual raw edge is the preserved frozen post-release snapshot bracketed by fast rows. No fast sample is invented.",
    "The final successor menu has no retained exit0; the whole game exit/WinMain and resource/PTD lifetime remain unproved.",
    "The guest route is a fixed legitimate input example, not a transferable host-native receipt or authorization. Host performance, fresh desktop window and cleanup allowance are unknown.",
    "No new wait observer was tested and no game collection was authorized. The current host menu source and guest route remain separate native lifetimes."
  ],
